Third-party components

Container images built from this repository bundle third-party software, and some of them are upstream projects compiled here. Each
component remains under its own license, which is not changed by this project.
The license declared on an image describes that image's first-party content.

- OpenResty (nginx distribution), BSD-2-Clause
- ModSecurity, Apache-2.0
- ModSecurity-nginx connector, Apache-2.0
- ngx_brotli, MIT
- OWASP Core Rule Set, Apache-2.0
- Caddy, Apache-2.0 (upstream source and standard modules)
- PostgreSQL, PostgreSQL License
- Grafana, AGPL-3.0-only (built from upstream sources by this repository)
- Loki, AGPL-3.0-only (built from upstream sources by this repository)
- Prometheus, Alertmanager, node-exporter, Apache-2.0 (built from upstream sources)
- Vector, MPL-2.0 (upstream image)
- PowerDNS Authoritative Server, GPL-2.0-only (built from upstream sources)
- DNSdist, GPL-2.0-only (built from upstream sources)

Consult each upstream project for its complete license text and notices.
